#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:721
msgid "Adds the two choices below to each vendor's own settings page. Switch this off to keep the decision yourself: vendors then see nothing about the monthly email, and the two settings below apply to all of them. Any choices vendors have already made are remembered and come back if you switch this on again."
